Shopify Uses AI to Write Better Code
​Shopify lets developers use AI to write computer code.
​At first, AI helped people write code very quickly.
​But sometimes the code became messy and hard to understand.
​The engineers wanted cleaner and simpler code.
​They changed the way they used AI.
​Now, developers check the AI's work more carefully.
​They improve the code before adding it to the project.
​AI helps with simple tasks and saves time.
​People still make the final decisions.
​Shopify says good software needs both AI and skilled developers.
​The writer says AI is a useful helper, but clean code comes from careful human work.
